WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.300
I was small and cheap, and I carried no camera at all.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.360
Instead I sniffed the Moon's surface from orbit and found hints of hydrogen hiding in the dark craters at the poles.

3
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:21.850
At the end, my team steered me into one of those craters.

4
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:31.830
I also carried something precious: some of the ashes of Gene Shoemaker, the scientist who taught the Apollo astronauts geology.

5
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:37.120
I carried a scientist's ashes to the Moon he never got to visit.
